    <string name="unofficial">Unofficial</string>
    <string name="notice_claude">Off by default. When on, AI·mana reads your Claude usage from an endpoint that is not a public API. Anthropic\'s Claude Code terms prohibit third-party apps from offering Claude.ai sign-in or storing its tokens. Turning this on is your decision; the provider has not authorized it, and it could limit or suspend your account. The endpoint can change or stop working at any time; AI·mana then falls back to the relay. You will sign in with your own account on this device. The session is stored encrypted on this device, shared with nobody, and signing out deletes it.</string>
    <string name="notice_codex">Off by default. When on, AI·mana reads your ChatGPT usage from an endpoint that is not a public API. OpenAI\'s terms restrict programmatic access to its services. Turning this on is your decision; the provider has not authorized it, and it could limit or suspend your account. The endpoint can change or stop working at any time; AI·mana then falls back to the relay. You will sign in with your own account on this device. The session is stored encrypted on this device, shared with nobody, and signing out deletes it.</string>
